{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"Don't leave a tip.|Not in Japan."},{"id":"s2","text":"All froze.|Wrong move."},{"id":"s3","text":"Take it back.|That's the fix."},{"id":"s4","text":"Same coins.|Right pocket."},{"id":"s5","text":"Change in hand.|Say thanks."},{"id":"s6","text":"He ran after—"},{"id":"s7","text":"Diners keep eating.|We just wait."},{"id":"s8","text":"Change back.|Everyone smiles."},{"id":"s9","text":"No tip.|Just thanks."},{"id":"n1","text":"No tipping.|Ever."},{"id":"n2","text":"Service is|in the price."},{"id":"n3","text":"Take your change.|Say thanks."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}